  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cod fish pieces and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped preserved lemon and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the tagine pot and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the fish hot, garnished with fresh parsley and lemon wedges."
